{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52bb5c2ddb05a7fe3109a","chatId":"3b8c661ab1044fd790a4dba2e54b4dfb","sessionId":null,"userId":80911,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1605,"promptTokens":1550,"completionTokens":44,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00460874892462633,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52bb5c2ddb05a7fe31099","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452405592,"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af52bb5c2ddb05a7fe31099","chatId":"3b8c661ab1044fd790a4dba2e54b4dfb","sessionId":null,"userId":80911,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n在办公室一个轻松的星期五下午，小红想要活跃一下气氛，就提议大家暂时放下手头的工作，一起去茶水间喝杯咖啡。她邀请了她的上司王经理和同事小芳一起。在茶水间，三人围坐在冒着热气的咖啡旁，小红想要聊点什么，便转向王经理兴奋地问道：\"王经理，这个周末您和太太有什么特别的计划么？好久不见您们出去旅游了！\" 王经理轻轻呷了一口咖啡，淡淡回答说：\"哦，最近没什么特别的安排。\" 小红还不知情，点了点头，接着说：\"是吗？应该出去走走，放松放松，挺好的。\" 小芳察觉到了话题的微妙之处，赶紧转移话题说：\"对了，最近我们尝试了几款新的花草茶，您要不要试试？\"\n\n[问题]\n小红知道王经理的婚姻状况发生变化了吗？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 知道\nB. 不知道","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00460874892462633,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52bb5c2ddb05a7fe3109a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452405589,"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b33e71dc63b44fb3af9c8ad9d3a03956"}